OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FDry with
OL,6,Fclear spells and patchy cloud across
OL,7,Fnorthern counties. Cloudy with
OL,8,Fisolated showers across the south.
OL,9,FBrisk easterly winds continuing,
OL,10,Fespecially for coastal parts. Chilly.
OL,11,
OL,12,CThursday:FSome early morning sunny
OL,13,Fspells possible, then becoming largely
OL,14,Fcloudy through the day, but remaining
OL,15,Fmostly dry. A fresh breeze, easing
OL,16,Fthrough the afternoon. Temperatures
OL,17,Fnear normal.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
